==Icelandic==

===Verb===
{{is-verb-strong|sá|sáu|séð}}

# to [[see]], to [[sense]] or [[perceive]] with one's [[eye]]s
#: '''''Sérðu''' illa?'' — ''Nei, ég '''sé''' mjög vel.''
#:: Have you got bad eyesight? — No, I '''see''' very well. 
# to [[see]], to [[perceive]], to [[spot]]{{jump|is|spot|s}}
# to [[see]], to [[understand]]{{jump|is|understand|s}}
#: ''Þú hlýtur að '''sjá''' hvað þetta er asnaleg hugmynd!''
#:: You must '''see''' what a stupid idea this is!

